<mxCell id="x31" value="Dashed arrow = «import»: the package at the tail uses classes of the package at the head. A tabbed folder is a Java package; the cube is the browser (not Java). Arrows without a label are also «import»." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=9;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1048" y="44" width="195" height="84" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="n32" value="Layers (top to bottom): controller → service → dao → model; dao.jdbc implements dao with SQL. model depends only on exception (its rules throw Validation / Conflict errors). security and payment are helper packages used by service (and controller → security for SessionManager). Built from the import statements in src/main/java, not from assumptions. Same-package use (for example model → model) is not drawn." style="shape=note;size=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#a8a26b;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="852" width="1220" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
